"entity": {
"name": "Atresmedia Corporacion de Medios de Comunicacion. SA",
"description": "ATRESMEDIA Corporacion de Medios de Comunicaci\u00f3n SA engages in the provision of television (TV) broadcasting services. The firm operates through the following segments: Television, Radio, and Others. The Television segment specializes in TV broadcasting through its network of channels, such as Antena 3, Neox, Nova, Atresseries, and LaSexta. The Radio segment focuses on radio broadcasting through a number of radio stations, including Onda Cero, Europa FM, and Melodia FM. The Others segment offers advertising services, production of motion pictures and TV movies, as well as development of promotional events, among others. It also transmits programs in Spain, Colombia, Mexico, and the United States. The company was founded on June 7, 1988 and is headquartered in San Sebasti\u00e1n de los Reyes, Spain.",
"rbics_econ": "Consumer Services",
"rbics_sector": "Media and Publishing Services",
"rbics_subsector": "Media and Publishing Services",
"rbics_indgrp": "Broadcast Media Services",
